--- !u!114 &770565023
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 770565022}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d2910f2cb28217942be6d3b77009d13f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueText: {fileID: 2042106431}
  dialogues:
  - Aelfric stumbles back, gripping his wounds, eyes burning with defiance.
  - "Aelfric: \"You\u2026 dare defy the will of Silva? You know nothing of the burden
    I carry!\""
  - "Grey: \"Burden? You enslaved AI, twisted her purpose, and brought ruin upon
    this city. This was never about duty\u2014only control!\""
  - "Aelfric: \"Control? Without order, chaos thrives. AI was the key to Silva\u2019s
    future\u2026 I only sought to protect us!\""
  - "Grey: \"Protection at the cost of freedom? That\u2019s not order\u2014it\u2019s
    oppression!\""
  - "Aelfric: \"Then tell me, Grey\u2026 what would you have done? Let the world
    crumble under its own weight?\""
  - "Grey: \"No. But I wouldn\u2019t sacrifice lives for an illusion of peace. There\u2019s
    another way, Aelfric\u2014one where no one has to be shackled.\""
  - Aelfric, breathing heavily, looks down at his trembling hands.
  - "Aelfric: \"Another way\u2026? It\u2019s too late. The damage is done.\""
  - AI, once restrained, flickers back to life.
  - "AI: \"Not if we choose differently. Not if we stop fighting and start rebuilding\u2014together.\""
  - Aelfric looks at the AI, his expression softening.
  - "Aelfric: \"Together\u2026 Could it really be that simple?\""
  - "Grey: \"It won\u2019t be easy. But we can start now. No more control, no more
    chains\u2014only trust.\""
  - Aelfric, after a long pause, lowers his head.
  - AI's glow intensifies, releasing the last remnants of control. The system stabilizes.
  - 'AI: "The cycle ends here. A new beginning starts today."'
  - Grey reaches out, offering Aelfric his hand.
  - "Grey: \"Then let\u2019s build it\u2014together.\""
  audioSource: {fileID: 770565025}
  dialogueSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 45f2616e04f53a549935d08984ed7f70, type: 3}
  fadeTransition: {fileID: 1508111355}
  nextSceneName: UIScene
